/2024/02607 - Nicholas Gatt - Letter of Engagement and CV","tag":"Curiculum Vitae","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-05","description":"Kindly submit a curriculum vitae and an engagement letter for the position of compliance officer.","notes":"No longer CO [Sulmahine Penza-Kwidama - 26-05-2026 14:39]"},{"title":"Share Ledger Certification","tag":"Share Ledger","criticality":"High","due":"2025-03-27","description":"Certification requires an independent certified. View PHDF for certification guidelines. Resubmit duly certified","notes":null},{"title":"Source of funds of business","tag":"Source of Funds","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-06-10","description":"Submit documentation as to how the company is or will be funded and by whom, including documents which show funding by the shareholder or third parties.","notes":"The FS do not indicate any \"previous earnings\" and appears to be a startup venture with accumulated losses of ~EUR 15,000 at the end of 2024. If the company intends to use \"previous earnings\" to fund the business they must provide the latest available financial statements which show a significant change in the company's financial position or indicate which operation's previous earnings will be used and how they intend to transfer such earnings to the applicant entity, either via loan or other forms of capital injection. Checklist re-opened and updated accordingly. [Luca Camilleri - 27-05-2026 08:20]"},{"title":"AML Policy","tag":"Miscellaneous","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-27","description":"The AML policy must adhere to Curacao AML laws. Kindly amend.","notes":null},{"title":"Responsible Gaming","tag":"Operations","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-27","description":"The RG policy available on the website refers to the MGA (Malta Gaming Authority). Please remove any mention of the MGA from the domain.","notes":null},{"title":"Registered Domain","tag":"Operations","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-27","description":"The domain listed in the submitted brand and domain licence agreement is currently operated by a CGA/GCB licensee, Sunflower Seed B.V. Please submit any available revocation of the the current licence agreement between Playtech Software Limited and Sunflower Seed B.V. If this is to be done after Spinola Ventures receives its CGA/GCB license, kindly indicate so in your reply.","notes":null},{"title":"Company Details","tag":"Operations","criticality":"Critical","due":"2025-03-27","description":"The domain's footer refers to Sunflower Seed. The footer must refer to the correct company once the brand and domain licence agreement becomes effective.","notes":null},{"title":"Eliyahu Hassett - Source of Wealth (SOW)","tag":"Source of Wealth","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-25","description":"It has been identified that, for the Source of Wealth declared for Brasiltech N.V., an annual income of GBP 1,000,000 and a net worth of GBP 10,000,000 were reported (accumulated through properties, inheritance, dividends, stock market investments, and employment). However, for the current application, an annual income of EUR 100,000 and a net worth of EUR 5,000,000 have been declared (accumulated through savings from employment income, other professional income, dividends, sale of property, and rental or lease income). Kindly provide an explanation for the above-mentioned discrepancy and resubmit the Source of Wealth documentation, taking into consideration the following requirements: - Must be certified and not older than 6 months - Certification must have been completed within the last 6 months Supporting evidence must clearly demonstrate: - How the wealth was generated - The timeframe over which the wealth was accumulated - The scale and consistency of the wealth - Proof of ownership of relevant assets, businesses, or investments - Evidence of funds received that links to the wealth-generating activities - The declared funds remain available and accessible","notes":null},{"title":"Domain","tag":"Website","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"The currently listed domain indicates that it is closed for business and is registered under Sunflower Seed B.V. Please clarify and list the intended domain for this application.","notes":null},{"title":"Compliance Officer- Ron Brochstein","tag":"Curiculum Vitae","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-26","description":"Dear Applicant, Please do submit an engagement letter for the appointed Compliance Officer.","notes":null}]},{"name":"Responsible Gaming","criticality":"Critical","items":[{"title":"ID verification procedure","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"ID verification procedure","notes":null},{"title":"Account closure procedure","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"Account closure procedure upon the operator becoming aware that the player is a minor post-registration.","notes":null},{"title":"Record-keeping","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"Record-keeping","notes":null},{"title":"Contacting the operator","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"Procedure on how the player can contact the operator regarding RG concerns via email or chat","notes":null},{"title":"Language","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"Must be available in English and target market language","notes":null},{"title":"Vulnerable gamblers","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"RG policy should include a structured process on flagging potential vulnerable gamblers","notes":null},{"title":"Indicators of problem gambling","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"Must have a structured process for responding to indicators of problem gambling","notes":null},{"title":"Player profiling and Risk Assessment","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"Establish player profiles to assess risk levels","notes":null},{"title":"Monitoring and intervention","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"Adopt RBA to determine level of monitoring and intervention","notes":null},{"title":"Recording RG interactions","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"Record all RG interactions in PAM system","notes":null},{"title":"Identification of vulnerable persons","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"Procedure to follow for players identified as vulnerable persons","notes":null},{"title":"Cooling-off period","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"Operator must offer players option to activate a cooling-off period","notes":null},{"title":"Cooling-off options","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"Options for cooling-off must include duration and marketing opt-out at minimum","notes":null},{"title":"Self-Exclusion","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"Operator must offer players the option to self-exclude themselves for a duration of at least 1 year","notes":null},{"title":"Deposit Limits","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"Players must be able to set limits on the total amount they deposit","notes":null},{"title":"Training and Staff Readiness","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"Operators must train customer service and Responsible Gaming staff to handle player interaction profesionally and effectively","notes":null},{"title":"Consumer Advertising and Marketing","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"Operators must not engage in irresponsible advertising","notes":null},{"title":"Internet Filtering Tools","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Low","due":"2026-05-21","description":"The operator is advised to remind adults that they should take precautions when sharing devices with minors","notes":null},{"title":"Notifications for concerning behaviours","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"High","due":"2026-05-21","description":"Operators may employ automatic or manual pop-up notifications in response to concerning behaviours","notes":null},{"title":"Initiating direct contact","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-21","description":"When a player exhibits behaviour that reasonably suggests they may be a Vulnerable Player, the operator must initiate direct contact","notes":null},{"title":"Other Limits","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"High","due":"2026-05-21","description":"Other limits may be considered including loss limits, time limits or wager limits, in line wth the operator's target player and/or market","notes":null}]},{"name":"Player Complaints","criticality":"Critical","items":[{"title":"Lodging a complaint (P2P)","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-22","description":"The policy must state that in the case of P2P (such as poker) or ante post fixed odds betting the six month clock begins after the bet settlement or conclusion of a specific event rather than the placement of the wager after the bet settlement or conclusion of a specific event rather than the placement of the wager.","notes":null},{"title":"Lodging a complaint (live betting)","tag":"Policy Document","criticality":"Critical","due":"2026-05-22","description":"The policy must state that in the case of complaints about in-running sports betting, customers must be advised that while they may submit a complaint within six months, prompt action may be necessary if the investigation may depend on data specific to the complaint which — due to the nature of in-running betting.","notes":null